OL,3,GNEWSADog charity celebrates century on
OL,4,Athe road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which helps to save more than
OL,7,F1,000 stray or abandoned dogs every
OL,8,Fyear is celebrating 100 years on the
OL,9,Froad.
OL,11,FThe National Canine Defence League -
OL,12,Fnow the Dogs Trust - purchased its
OL,13,Ffirst ambulance in 1926.
OL,15,FOperating from a base in Penrith,
OL,16,FCumbria, the charity's vehicles
OL,17,Ftransport unwanted animals to rehoming
OL,18,Fcentres across the UK or into local
OL,19,Ffoster care.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
